    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A necromancer is disturbing a local graveyard, and his skeletal legions rise from the grave! In <i>Tomb of the Overlord</i>, up to four players venture into cursed crypts, forests and graveyards, fight through waves of undead, and uncover lost secrets to grow stronger. Choose your starting class, then expand your abilities through a deep multiclass system, combining attacks, spells, auras, summons, and other powerful abilities to create your perfect build. Will you become an unstoppable warrior-mage, a cunning rogue-priest, or something entirely unique?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run brings new challenges, new loot, and new ways to master the battlefield. Team up with friends or go solo in your quest to help a local alchemist get some grave moss or clean up some bandits from the local graveyard, and hope you don't run into any trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.poster.avif?t=1748977906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.webm?t=1748977906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.mp4?t=1748977906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1-4 Player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Brave the tombs alone or with friends in online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiclass System</strong> \u2013 Mix and match attacks, spells, auras, and summons from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Ability Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock devastating melee strikes, ranged spells, lingering auras, summoned minions, and other abilities as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in real-time battles with fluid movement, dodge mechanics, and skill-based attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover areas that may change with hidden secrets, randomized elements, and event-driven paths leading to new challenges every attempt.<br></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A necromancer is disturbing a local graveyard, and his skeletal legions rise from the grave! In <i>Tomb of the Overlord</i>, up to four players venture into cursed crypts, forests and graveyards, fight through waves of undead, and uncover lost secrets to grow stronger. Choose your starting class, then expand your abilities through a deep multiclass system, combining attacks, spells, auras, summons, and other powerful abilities to create your perfect build. Will you become an unstoppable warrior-mage, a cunning rogue-priest, or something entirely unique?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run brings new challenges, new loot, and new ways to master the battlefield. Team up with friends or go solo in your quest to help a local alchemist get some grave moss or clean up some bandits from the local graveyard, and hope you don't run into any trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.poster.avif?t=1748977906\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.webm?t=1748977906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867160/extras/261726fc54235f201345ce08f9dc3833.mp4?t=1748977906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1-4 Player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Brave the tombs alone or with friends in online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiclass System</strong> \u2013 Mix and match attacks, spells, auras, and summons from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Ability Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock devastating melee strikes, ranged spells, lingering auras, summoned minions, and other abilities as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> \u2013 Engage in real-time battles with fluid movement, dodge mechanics, and skill-based attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover areas that may change with hidden secrets, randomized elements, and event-driven paths leading to new challenges every attempt.<br></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Delve into the depths of the Tomb of the Overlord, a co-op action RPG where you battle relentless undead, master powerful classes, and forge your own path through multiclass progression.",
